      <a name="format" val="markdownish"/>
      <a name="text" val="SevenSegmentMultiplexer4 takes four 8-bit inputs and multiplexes these onto a 4-digit SevenSegement display. It relies on an external refresh pulse to drive the display at a reasonable rate. Using a Timed Pulse generator set to approx 1ms is ideal. Somewhat faster or slower rates should be fine as well, but very slow rates may lead to visible flicker."/>
